# Learn: "Move the mallet" (travel 40 units with the arrow keys once the
# countdown ends) to its results, then Next: "Strike the puck" (the puck
# waits at row 70 straight ahead: push up into it) to its results.
until 300 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click =Learn
until 60 One rule at a time
frames 10
click Move the mallet
until 30 Move it 40 units
frames 200
hold ArrowUp
frames 40
release ArrowUp
until 200 =Lesson complete
frames 10
save lesson-move
click Next: Strike the puck
frames 200
hold ArrowUp
frames 60
release ArrowUp
until 200 =Lesson complete
frames 10
save lesson-strike
click Menu
until 60 Daily Challenge
